// An empty path names no file, so the metadata calls answer for no file
// (spec/05-stdlib.md, Strings the host reads). A consumer that resolves the
// empty path to the working directory, as the JDK does, answers true, true,
// and a Map instead.
// STATUS: ok
// CHECK: false
// CHECK: false
// CHECK: false
// CHECK: true
// COVERS: host-string exists
// COVERS: host-string is_dir
// COVERS: host-string is_file
// COVERS: host-string stat
print exists("");
print is_dir("");
print is_file("");
print stat("") == nil;
